# Apple ID sessions and downloaded apps must never be committed.
/accounts/
/library/
*.ipa

# Build output.
#
# ANCHORED, and the anchor is load-bearing: a bare `springback` matches at EVERY depth, so it
# also matched `core/cmd/springback/` and silently excluded the package containing main.go. The
# first commit went out without it and built fine, because the Docker build has its own copy of
# the tree — nothing surfaced the omission until a clean checkout was tried.
/springback

# GitHub Actions workflows live in deploy/ci/ and are COPIED here, not edited here.
#
# Not a preference: the credential this repo is pushed with is a GitHub App without the
# `workflows` permission, so any push that touches .github/workflows is rejected outright —
# including pushes that only meant to change Go code. Keeping the canonical copies under
# deploy/ci/ keeps them in version control and keeps every other push working. See deploy/ci/README.md.
/.github/
